{"seq":1,"slug":"line-of-sight","title":"视线判定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-fog-of-war-visibility/computation/line-of-sight","wordCount":1626,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"视线判定\">视线判定</h1><p>视线判定是整个可见性体系的原子操作：判断从一点到另一点的直线有没有被挡住。它看起来只是「画条线、检查沿途格子」，但魔鬼全在离散化的细节里——同一条逻辑直线，从 A 走向 B 和从 B 走向 A，在网格上可能踩中不同的格子，于是得到互相矛盾的结论。这一篇专讲点对点视线：怎样在网格上走出一条线、怎样处理它穿过格角的歧义、以及它为何无法独力扛起整片视野的计算。它是 <a href=\"shadowcasting-fov\">阴影投射视野</a> 的退化情形，也是 AI 感知与远程命中判定共享的底层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>点对点视线判定求解 <a href=\"../foundations/visibility-problem\">可见性问题</a> 的原子形式：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>、遮挡集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>，问线段 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">‾</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\overline{ot}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord overline\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8151em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7351em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"overline-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是否与任何遮挡相交。在网格上，这归结为「枚举线段经过的格子，逐个检查是否不透明」。枚举方式有三大类：Bresenham 整数直线、DDA（数字微分分析）浮点步进、以及精确的格子穿越（supercover）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[视线判定 o 到 t] --&gt; B[选择网格遍历方式]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Bresenham&lt;br/&gt;整数, 每步一格]&#10;    B --&gt; D[DDA&lt;br/&gt;浮点累加步进]&#10;    B --&gt; E[Supercover&lt;br/&gt;所有被触格]&#10;    C --&gt; F[逐格检查不透明]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G{遇到遮挡?}&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[不可见 返回 false]&#10;    G --&gt;|否, 到达 t| I[可见 返回 true]\">flowchart TD\n    A[视线判定 o 到 t] --&gt; B[选择网格遍历方式]\n    B --&gt; C[Bresenham&lt;br/&gt;整数, 每步一格]\n    B --&gt; D[DDA&lt;br/&gt;浮点累加步进]\n    B --&gt; E[Supercover&lt;br/&gt;所有被触格]\n    C --&gt; F[逐格检查不透明]\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G{遇到遮挡?}\n    G --&gt;|是| H[不可见 返回 false]\n    G --&gt;|否, 到达 t| I[可见 返回 true]</pre><p>下表对比三种遍历，权衡在于「速度」「对称性」「是否漏穿格角」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>数学基础</th>\n<th>每步代价</th>\n<th>对称性</th>\n<th>会漏穿格角</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Bresenham</td>\n<td>整数误差累加</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>否（方向相关）</td>\n<td>是（斜穿角时）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DDA</td>\n<td>浮点步进 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_x, t_y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>取决于实现</td>\n<td>可控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Supercover</td>\n<td>触及所有相交格</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"bresenham-快但不对称\">Bresenham：快但不对称</h2><p>Bresenham 直线最初为画线发明，借来做视线判定的好处是纯整数、极快。它维护一个误差项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span>，每前进一格主轴方向就累加斜率，误差越界时副轴进一格：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>当 </mtext><mi>ε</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mtext> 时副轴 </mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>ε</mi><mo>−</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon \\mathrel{+}= \\frac{\\Delta y}{\\Delta x}, \\qquad \\text{当 } \\varepsilon \\ge 0.5 \\text{ 时副轴 } +1,\\ \\varepsilon \\mathrel{-}= 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">当</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">时副轴</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>问题在于：起点和终点对调后，误差累加的相位不同，走出的格子序列可能不一样——于是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span></span></span></span></span> 看得见 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 看不见 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span></span></span></span></span>，破坏了 <a href=\"../foundations/visibility-problem\">可见性问题</a> 中强调的对称性。补救常见两招：(1) 永远从两端中坐标较小者出发（强制方向一致）；(2) 双向各跑一次取「都通」才算可见（保守，偏向遮挡）。竞技游戏宁可保守也不要单向视野，因为单向偷袭比偶尔多挡一格更伤公平。</p>\n<h2 id=\"格角歧义-对角线该不该穿\">格角歧义：对角线该不该穿</h2><p>网格视线最经典的坑是<strong>对角穿角</strong>：两堵墙在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x,y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(x{+}1,y{+}1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 形成一个对角夹角，一条恰好穿过它们公共顶点的视线，到底算通还是不算通？三种约定各有取舍。<strong>宽松</strong>：只要视线数学上不与墙体内部相交就算通——会出现「贴着两墙夹缝斜看过去」，玩家觉得像穿墙。<strong>严格</strong>：碰到任一相邻不透明格就算挡——绝不穿角，但会让某些本该看见的斜角变看不见。<strong>中庸</strong>：要求至少一侧透明才放行。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[视线穿过格角] --&gt; B{两侧格状态}&#10;    B --&gt;|两侧都是墙| C[严格: 挡&lt;br/&gt;宽松: 可能穿]&#10;    B --&gt;|一侧墙一侧空| D[多数约定: 通]&#10;    B --&gt;|两侧都空| E[一致: 通]&#10;    C --&gt; F[必须全局统一约定&lt;br/&gt;否则不对称]\">flowchart TD\n    A[视线穿过格角] --&gt; B{两侧格状态}\n    B --&gt;|两侧都是墙| C[严格: 挡&lt;br/&gt;宽松: 可能穿]\n    B --&gt;|一侧墙一侧空| D[多数约定: 通]\n    B --&gt;|两侧都空| E[一致: 通]\n    C --&gt; F[必须全局统一约定&lt;br/&gt;否则不对称]</pre><p>关键不是选哪种，而是<strong>全局只选一种并保持一致</strong>。对角约定不一致会再次破坏对称性，并制造「这个角能看那个角不能看」的迷惑体验。Red Blob Games 的薄墙视野研究专门讨论了这些角落情形。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dda-与精确穿越\">DDA 与精确穿越</h2><p>当墙体不在格中心而在格边（薄墙模型），或需要可控的穿越精度时，DDA 更合适。它把射线参数化为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">o + s\\cdot \\vec{d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9774em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9774em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0688em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，分别算出跨越下一条竖直格线与水平格线所需的参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_x, t_y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，每步取较小者推进、进入相邻格、更新该轴的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>。这与 <a href=\"./\">视野计算</a> 后续算法和光线步进同源，好处是能精确知道射线先穿哪条边、在哪个参数处碰到遮挡，从而支持部分遮挡的透光率累乘 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∏</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\prod_i (1-\\alpha_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（高草、烟雾）。</p>\n<p><strong>Supercover</strong> 变体则枚举射线触及的每一个格（包括擦边格），是最保守、最对称的遍历——若任一被触格不透明即判挡。它最贵但最不会漏，适合对正确性要求极高、查询不频繁的场景，比如关键的命中判定。频繁查询时它的代价见 <a href=\"../practice/visibility-performance\">可见性性能</a> 的讨论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么单点查询撑不起整片视野\">为什么单点查询撑不起整片视野</h2><p>视线判定是原子的，但用它直接算整片 FOV 是个陷阱。要点亮一个半径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 的圆形视野，朴素做法是对边界上每个格各投一条射线——这正是 raycasting FOV，问题有二：<strong>漏格</strong>，相邻射线之间会跳过近处该被照亮的格，出现暗斑；<strong>重复</strong>，近处的格被许多条射线反复访问，复杂度浪费在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(r^2 \\cdot r) = O(r^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 量级。更糟的是它天生不对称（每条射线单向投出）。</p>\n<p>这正是 <a href=\"shadowcasting-fov\">阴影投射视野</a> 存在的理由：它不逐射线投，而是按行/列从近到远递推可见的角度区间，每格恰好访问一次（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(r^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>），且通过判定格中心可见来保证对称。视线判定的正确角色，是作为这些聚合算法内部的子程序、以及作为「只关心某两点之间」的稀疏查询（远程命中、AI 是否看得到目标），而非整片视野的主算法。AI 把视线判定当感知输入的用法，属于 <a href=\"../../game-ai/decision-systems/finite-state-machine\">游戏 AI（03）</a> 的范畴，本 hub 只到「提供这个布尔查询」为止。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>视线判定是可见性的原子操作：判断线段是否与遮挡相交，网格上有 Bresenham、DDA、Supercover 三类遍历。</li>\n<li>Bresenham 最快但方向相关、会破坏对称，需用「从小坐标出发」或「双向取交」来补救。</li>\n<li>对角穿角有宽松/严格/中庸三种约定，必须全局统一一种，否则再次破坏对称并制造迷惑视野。</li>\n<li>DDA 支持精确穿越与部分遮挡的透光率累乘；Supercover 最保守对称但最贵。</li>\n<li>用单点查询逐射线算整片 FOV 会漏格、重复、不对称（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(r^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>），应改用阴影投射；视线判定的正确角色是子程序与稀疏点对点查询。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章：<a href=\"shadowcasting-fov\">阴影投射视野</a> 是整片 FOV 的正解，内部仍以视线为概念；<a href=\"grid-visibility-fields\">网格可见性场</a> 把大量点对点查询批量化。</li>\n<li>基础：本篇求解的查询定义见 <a href=\"../foundations/visibility-problem\">可见性问题</a>。</li>\n<li>跨库：把视线当 AI 感知输入见 <a href=\"../../game-ai/decision-systems/finite-state-machine\">游戏 AI 的有限状态机</a>；连续射线遮挡测试与 <a href=\"../../game-camera-systems/framing-control/collision-occlusion\">相机系统的碰撞与遮挡</a> 同源。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"视线判定","id":"视线判定"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Bresenham：快但不对称","id":"bresenham-快但不对称"},{"level":2,"text":"格角歧义：对角线该不该穿","id":"格角歧义-对角线该不该穿"},{"level":2,"text":"DDA 与精确穿越","id":"dda-与精确穿越"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么单点查询撑不起整片视野","id":"为什么单点查询撑不起整片视野"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"迷雾三态模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-fog-of-war-visibility/foundations/fog-state-model"},"next":{"title":"阴影投射视野","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-fog-of-war-visibility/computation/shadowcasting-fov"}}